.00-456691","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"To identify new susceptibility loci to lung cancer among diverse populations, we performed cross-ancestry genome-wide association studies in European, East Asian and African populations and discovered five loci that have not been previously reported. We replicated 26 signals and identified 10 new lead associations from previously reported loci. Rare-variant associations tended to be specific to populations, but even common-variant associations influencing smoking behavior, such as those with CHRNA5 and CYP2A6, showed population specificity. Fine-mapping and expression quantitative trait locus colocalization nominated several candidate variants and susceptibility genes such as IRF4 and FUBP1. DNA damage assays of prioritized genes in lung fibroblasts indicated that a subset of these genes, including the pleiotropic gene IRF4, potentially exert effects by promoting endogenous DNA damage.","author_count":85,"contributors":["Byun, Jinyoung","Han, Younghun","Li, Yafang","Xia, Jun","Long, Erping","Choi, Jiyeon","Xiao, Xiangjun","Zhu, Meng","Zhou, Wen","Sun, Ryan","Bossé, Yohan","Song, Zhuoyi","Schwartz, Ann","Lusk, Christine","Rafnar, Thorunn","Stefansson, Kari","Zhang, Tongwu","Zhao, Wei","Pettit, Rowland W.","Liu, Yanhong","Li, Xihao","Zhou, Hufeng","Walsh, Kyle M.","Gorlov, Ivan","Gorlova, Olga","Zhu, Dakai","Rosenberg, Susan M.","Pinney, Susan","Bailey-Wilson, Joan E.","Mandal, Diptasri","de Andrade, Mariza","Gaba, Colette","Willey, James C.","You, Ming","Anderson, Marshall","Wiencke, John K.","Albanes, Demetrius","Lam, Stephan","Tardon, Adonina","Chen, Chu","Goodman, Gary","Bojesen, Stig E","Brenner, Hermann","Landi, Maria Teresa","Chanock, Stephen J.","Johansson, Mattias","Muley, Thomas","Risch, Angela","Wichmann, H. Erich","Bickeböller, Heike","Christiani, David C.","Rennert, Gad","Arnold, Susanne","Field, John K.","Shete, Sanjay","Le Marchand, Loic","Melander, Olle","Brunnstrom, Hans","Liu, Geoffrey","Andrew, Angeline S.","Kiemeney, Lambertus A.","Shen, Hongbing","Zienolddiny, Shanbeh","Grankvist, Kjell","Johansson, Mikael","Caporaso, Neil","Cox, Angela","Hong, Yun Chul","Yuan, Jian Min","Lazarus, Philip","Schabath, Matthew B.","Aldrich, Melinda C.","Patel, Alpa","Lan, Qing","Rothman, Nathaniel","Taylor, Fiona","Kachuri, Linda","Witte, John S.","Sakoda, Lori C.","Spitz, Margaret","Brennan, Paul","Lin, Xihong","McKay, James","Hung, Rayjean J.","Amos, Christopher I."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-472991"],"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Austria","Canada","China","France","Germany","Iceland","Israel","Netherlands","Norway","South Korea","Spain","Sweden","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","American Cancer Society","Baylor College of Medicine","British Columbia Cancer Agency","Cancer Cluster Salzburg","Clalit Health Services","Dartmouth College","Duke University","Fred Hutchinson Cancer Research Center","German Cancer Research Center","German Center for Lung Research","Harvard University","Helmholtz Zentrum München - German Research Center for Environmental Health","Houston Methodist Hospital","International Agency for Research on Cancer","Kaiser Permanente","Laval University","Louisiana State University Health Sciences Center","Lund University","Mayo Clinic College of Medicine and Science","Nanjing Medical University","National Institute of Occupational Health","National Institutes of Health","Princess Margaret Cancer Center","Radboud University Nijmegen","Seoul National University College of Medicine","Sinai Health System","Stanford University","Swedish Medical Center","Umeå University","University of California San Francisco","University of Cincinnati","University of Göttingen","University of Hawai'i at Mānoa","University of Kentucky","University of Liverpool","University of Oviedo","University of Pittsburgh","University of Salzburg","University of Sheffield","University of South Florida","University of Texas Health Science Center at Houston","University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center","University of Toledo","University of Toronto","Vanderbilt University","Washington State University Spokane","Wayne State University","deCODE Genetics"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cross ancestry genome wide meta analysis of 000000000061 000000000047 cases and 000000000947 000000000237 controls identifies new susceptibility loci contributing to lung cancer","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41588-022-01115-x","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-472991","identifier":[{"id":"85135272569","type":"scopus"},{"id":"35915169","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC9373844","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-84eba12b-9079-49c7-9785-61451a6eeda3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EC85EE17D411F07DCCF14912C0364F9C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41588-022-01115-x","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/about/copyright/","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/362317792/Cross_ancestry_genome_wide_meta_analysis.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"us","key":"baylor college of medicine","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Baylor College of Medicine","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"national institutes of health","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"National Institutes of Health","us